al Result**\n\nHence we have proved that all non\u2011negative integers  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\,0\\le k\\le n-2\\,}\n\\]\n\nare admissible. The cases \\(k=n-1\\) and \\(k=n\\) remain unresolved."
